<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002U_S0003" variety="S0003">
<name>Glass &amp; Window</name>
<ttl id="1002U_S0003_744CF_T004B" variety="T004B">
<name>Power Window System</name>
<para id="RM0000005E500VX" category="U" type-id="303FP" name-id="7527D-00" from="200612">
<name>Fail-safe List</name>
<subpara id="RM0000005E500VX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___000025O00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If there is a malfunction in the pulse sensor in the power window regulator motor assembly RH (driver side, rear right) or power window regulator motor assembly LH (front passenger side, rear left), the fail-safe function operates.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<step2>
<ptxt>If there is a malfunction in the pulse sensor for jam protection operation, the window position or the learned value, the following power window operations are prohibited.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="4" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Power Window Operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
<ptxt>Key-off operation active</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
<ptxt>Key-off operation inactive</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Manual UP</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Manual DOWN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operates</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>When AUTO UP is held</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operates (manual UP operation while AUTO UP is held) (no jam protection operation)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>AUTO UP</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>AUTO DOWN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Operation prohibited</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the pulse sensor is normal, holding manual operation (AUTO UP held) for 1 seconds or more cancels the fail-safe and enables AUTO operation.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>If there is a LIN communication malfunction (communication stop), power window operation is as follows. (Can be operated only with the power window switch of each seat)</ptxt>
<step3>
<ptxt>Power Window Regulator Motor Assembly RH (Driver Side)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Power Window Operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Manual UP</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates (with jam protection operation)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Manual DOWN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>Power Window Regulator Motor Assembly RH (Rear Right), Power Window Regulator Motor Assembly LH (Front Passenger Side, Rear Left)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Power Window Operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Manual UP</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates (with jam protection operation)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Manual DOWN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>When AUTO UP is held</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates (with jam protection operation)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>AUTO UP</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates (with jam protection operation)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>AUTO DOWN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Operates</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</step3>
</step2>
</step1>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
